    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that Marcus sends the release notes to Ingrid by Wednesday 2026-11-04 at 11:00 Central, which is 18:00 in Berlin, with recheck passed. The other remarks were recorded as stated and not as confirmed. No unresolved item was listed.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed that Marcus sends the 4.2 release notes to Ingrid by Wednesday 2026-11-04 at 11:00 Central, which is 18:00 in Berlin, with confirmation by Ingrid, Marcus and Priya and recheck passed.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- Someone stated that Marcus should get the release notes by end of day tomorrow.\n- Someone stated that end of day tomorrow works.\n- Someone stated they will review and publish them.\n- Someone stated they will group them by feature, fixes and deprecations.\n- Someone stated to call out the export change.\n- Someone stated they will put it at the top with a short how-to.\n- Someone stated the rollout itself starts Thursday at 8 o'clock my time.\n- Someone stated 10% first.\n- Someone stated they will have the help center drafts ready to fill up on Thursday.\n- Someone asked whether to mention the API rate limit change.\n- Someone stated to mention it in one line and link to the developer docs.\n- Someone stated that works for them."
